{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About this Demo</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the core gameplay of Deckbane with these features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as the Heart Clan Leader</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recruit 15 unique friends to form your initial adventure team</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect 28  item cards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock 20 cute pets to team up with the Leader or friends</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Full Version Includes Additional Content</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Four clan leaders: Heart, Spade, Diamond, and Club leaders all playable</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand to 30 friends, unlocking more team combination strategies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless Mode &amp; Daily Challenge</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >50 item cards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >40 pets </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Achievement system  </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world is being consumed by the overwhelming resentment of gamblers.<br>Bankrupt madmen, corrupt dealers, greedy spirits\u2026 Their bitterness and rage have morphed into a sinister energy, devouring everything in its path.<br>You must wield the &quot;gambler\u2019s magic,&quot; build a unique deck, and confront this spreading madness!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Play Cards! Break the Curse with Your Hand</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Form classic poker hands\u2014Pairs, Straights, Flushes, Full Houses\u2014to build up your heroes\u2019 morale and unleash powerful actions!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4070340/extras/1956e9206c6c2f86d7889450c81aeab7.poster.avif?t=1759720458\" width=616 heig